schema_examples:
Example minimal schema (as plain text):
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "query": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
    "top_k": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 100 },
    "mode": { "type": "string", "enum": ["fast", "accurate"] }
  },
  "required": ["query"]
}
Notes: use enum for small fixed sets; prefer explicit numeric bounds. Avoid complex union forms unless documented (see compatibility guideline).
